  "id": "c8d9ec6305ec626294a79cfe",
  "title": "忍者神龟3",
  "summary": "童年阴影系列，微笑继续。本篇又名：一块披萨引发的回忆。 这是当年包机房里的大热门游戏。名字有点歧义，甚至我20年前写《激龟忍者传》时的认知都是错的：日版是忍者神龟2，美版因为把激龟忍者传也算了进去，所以是忍者神龟3，盗版一般盗的是美版，所以也应该算3。 这次的阴影不少人也能猜到：打不死的斯雷德。当年游戏开发商为了防止盗版，给游戏上了特殊的加密。最有名的就包括一碰就死的《外星战将》，第二关BOSS不死的《特救指令》和本作，第六关BOSS不死的《忍者神龟3》。显然，一碰就死和第二关过不去属于早死早升天的爽快死法，其伤害性远远小于打了一个多小时之后第六关过不去。 故事放到我身上，是加了料的： 话说我大爷1991年秋天的时候再婚，大娘是寡妇带了个儿子。白捡的堂哥属羊头，我属猴屁股，他大我20个月，差不多两岁，高我一届…",
  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/6d4e98719aadb57cbefc8d9a0b7cc61b47ac06d1b2c164e5f85a16d7900f9397c5d8905e0746fe3ce33ffbb11930c8e0d0da55e22fe886a33c2c9fbcf8e8cfdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">忍者神龟3：曼哈顿计划</a></p>\n<p>童年阴影系列，微笑继续。本篇又名：一块披萨引发的回忆。<br>\n这是当年包机房里的大热门游戏。名字有点歧义，甚至我20年前写<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/f60177c5375aedae9ccaab675f83c1f3bc510292a8f603da5cf045d0222b1b08388e5ec38248fe9b2ac24afeb9e614a46faef587bf470d8921030e79e9c3d1372c8035c7d57d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">《激龟忍者传》</a>时的认知都是错的：日版是忍者神龟2，美版因为把激龟忍者传也算了进去，所以是忍者神龟3，盗版一般盗的是美版，所以也应该算3。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/09c6bcbc55674fd6bfabbb53420d6be30b688967804d9629812e89b25c78362262e6f998ee2ba1f4b8b3ad8ac52a2b4d2d21be518f0b77e4ba4391ab947dd2c4392feb004e1f4f6cf786e0e6643b14c9d7cea8b4be5746ad6d11b63a24ea1a524f348ab05cec5a1a2ddd7673807aea9127e9d28db75aeedb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_000\"></a></p>\n<p>这次的阴影不少人也能猜到：打不死的斯雷德。当年游戏开发商为了防止盗版，给游戏上了特殊的加密。最有名的就包括一碰就死的《外星战将》，第二关BOSS不死的《特救指令》和本作，第六关BOSS不死的《忍者神龟3》。显然，一碰就死和第二关过不去属于早死早升天的爽快死法，其伤害性远远小于打了一个多小时之后第六关过不去。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/3c425e9096374f59402d9d59743f48aae161bd8d20ea3f02cda7a046f0cb5e05d192e2597d8e2264692192753a531b4b7078110a19425cc2a5b590152c5e75f2e8e3a0215530f3bb6fbf0010cebf023f546eb6e002aaf522e36b6b681b9f281571714fc6eca71b6e91f6f864ab49014fd88240a4389fe76a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_001\"></a></p>\n<p>故事放到我身上，是加了料的：<br>\n话说我大爷1991年秋天的时候再婚，大娘是寡妇带了个儿子。白捡的堂哥属羊头，我属猴屁股，他大我20个月，差不多两岁，高我一届。<br>\n大娘很快发现我妈是奶奶家这边的话事人，就千方百计讨好以达成间接讨好我妈的目的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/5528d1c5edc0c1cbf02bce5693983ba71afc04d573a08a10fd2b03fe3261ba41645b43bd9d256402d3f7530c4e8d13b4f1fcfd39121e29dabf8e1cd0af92702a9e06ed8e704c9f3f892f9d00edb28cbf2131c493605dfe7d871ddef77676342f28cd5e336000ee8c5a5d5440333055156e3775bc6134d1fd\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_025\"></a></p>\n<p>1993年小升初暑假，我照例被寄存在奶奶家。某天，二手堂哥忽然来找我，要我去他家玩。<br>\n他说的“家”是我大娘自己原来的房子，离我大爷大娘那个万人大厂很近，离市区很远。<br>\n我犹豫了3秒就答应了。对我来说最大的吸引力在于，没大人管。二手堂哥那时不喜欢和我大爷住一起，准初二了而且是放假期间，吃饭只需要直接进厂去找我大娘。他是一个人住的。<br>\n此外他们家不光有厂内的闭路电视看，还承诺了要请我打电游。<br>\n他请我打的正是《忍者神龟3》。他们厂子那一带穷乡僻壤，电游厅（包机房）单价也便宜，1块钱40分钟。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/1bacf117d50061a537cd15e4a4c442dae36b05a7cfea8c5b34ae397dc74c9cf45af43f5886da0e3ef3b3bad5bf3f425e413e6f99c31aacbafac41378d300c18574f11102a66c5ae62c1112894b9131f6f7ff82ec798d0b2409977da1e0b8ccf7a138eff5581eaf1d5ba6d430f8010864bd19731564231c5a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_005\"></a></p>\n<p>防盗版机制令游戏难度直接变成HARD，敌人都变得皮糙血厚。他花第3块钱的时候我们才见到斯雷德。等我俩打了十几分钟斯雷德还打不死的时候，老板提示说时间要到了，并且友善提醒：这个斯雷德是打不死的，别白费力气了。<br>\n这时旁边有位观战的大哥忽然冒出一句：“只有打斯雷德之前一个馅饼（回血道具）都不吃才能把他打死。”<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/a1544860ca62ab2b598c590f79014ce8042be199d6aeb75c3ccdb20cda1be731dd3fdc9feb80271c7d76952a705a194e18a78c9ca9648c0e4fe6fd2fe1be8b8d69db165d28ab4be1756e283db403c1c90b8ebde46cc65d9a616609ec1b736e4f409a8b51f0aead9cfd4f8c50e0049b95217f258ee4653cbf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_030\"></a></p>\n<p>第二天回家之后我妈因为我跟“外人”走了把我臭骂一顿。并且要求我找机会请二手堂哥玩点什么，不能占他便宜。<br>\n1993年的中秋节是9月30号。中秋节自己家聚会，第二天有远房亲戚来看望我奶奶。于是第二天的时候就拉他回请，继续玩《忍者神龟3》。<br>\n我奶奶家附近的包机房是正常的1块钱30分钟，但好运气，是30条命的hack版。这次花了4块钱。小心翼翼的不碰馅饼，结果涛声依旧。<br>\n不吃披萨也不能打死BOSS这件事让我直接龙场悟道：“爱科学，传谣不信谣。”<br>\n这也是为什么后来我在电游厅为什么能顺嘴说出“<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/4fb6955ee8484736df8853606d7f6d2f8657a3b485ea1fe3d4157d18c445bd6028d6de038d16e4fc223ebbed759790bfe033e6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">黑暗海豹</a>”去忽悠别人。既然吃了亏，就要拉更多的人进坑。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/a12c4bfd3ff5410e5edf6fce71e05ba8ff8256a6244a62350912ad75b9512b279b21791f07a6adb1de0e02ae8c2e83cec0f19cb42ef0426c5bb9109b05c8a7ee809620a8d8308738672547eb404bf72efc15e265ec04bd9f60231bc8c807859b4c28d9966a5459f2bf2b3d19729af55c2fd716f44da54626\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_013\"></a></p>\n<p>要说当年就真的没有通关的方法了吗？倒也未必。除了有可能出现的正版卡以外，也有传闻，使用“魂斗罗30条命秘技”是可以选关的，把斯雷德跳过去不就行了。我和二手堂哥也都各自实验了一下，都没成功就放弃了。现在得知真相：《忍者神龟3代》美版选关秘技是<strong>↑↑↓↓←→←→AB</strong>，而我是熟练精准掌握魂斗罗秘技的，只按BA完事，二手堂哥是冗余派的BABA，我们都没按错，也不属于另外一个ABBA的错误派别，所以就一步之遥咯。<br>\n小马过河是世界上最好的寓言，只不过验证这件事，是要付出成本的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/fed7d73f7be305da5cec5f15fbe39166da817cb940d1352f6b8fbdc2a6e95747c4d90122c720833639f24bdd957e97b8b94bbe996ea2adfbb22dc73715e3715a2384a3897f0ffa1968d7cb6db0bfd0e4b2fece3f8496b186d3b7734dae8dcc14c683248d4715791a37252343c9baa23c6016459ef73cbeba\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_018\"></a></p>\n<p>说回游戏。本作日版发行于1991年，美版是1992年，FC发展到此时已经是大成阶段，所以这款游戏在画质音乐都非常优秀，游戏性和趣味性比前作更是强出一大截。最大的特色是设计了不同的“绝招”代替之前的“扇脸蛋子”。最好用的依旧是达芬奇，双刀可以封线且多打BOSS几次；其次是多纳泰罗（爱因斯坦），翻滚攻击多段输出；拉斐尔的绝招类似街霸里警察的“窜电”，出招快，连打带跑，安全性高；米开朗基罗的绝招最差，出招慢且主要对空，适用范围极逼仄。<br>\n发这种大招是要掉血的，不过扣到最后一滴血就不会再扣了。由此也诞生了动作游戏小白最普遍的玩法：只要不停放大招就好。这种玩法有两个缺点，一是被碰一下就挂了；另一个是，因为绝招并不是两个键无脑同时按下，而是要先点一下跳在几帧之内再按拳，所以非常累手。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/12c2dd6016337aa4d1b2920859520049fb9c9132b8905188c6eba4f3ea210719433c788dfc0f5795e128436a8effb0911d960bacf1a400ee96e500c8e20f23939191cef3081cc4d8eea67d8de67020cceb196b43d552402550698367f4824b7d2bfd39b340a16326c00c0c3f9deb6279ac6c70e67daad664\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_007\"></a></p>\n<p>高端的玩家玩法要优雅很多，他们用的是另一个新出的招式“下挑”，一般的福特兵一下一个。这招也非常累手，这回累的是左手。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/7b7f24a5249ecc960ca93c68e4261d6d9940ab10b0c1b4b9fb97a6640803e4055d2154b44022434b9f231b30b754c6d67198a43279260074beaafa099970fd20885a8df07ac24320896f91047acea11be7fd7c13aa61f6f71d2a3eb0cc13c0fce8886dca0ef34a3c5befc58111b6d6c75bae8ce5c86a80dd\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_006\"></a></p>\n<p>科纳米这次把福特兵的种类设计得异常丰富，长枪、铁桶、鞭子、铁砧、回旋镖，甚至还有专门扬沙子的。尤其倒数第二关有个电梯场景，所有敌人拉出来遛一圈，挺带感的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/9c7f97f22feafd6cfb4153243b0bb1bb9869f75bffd700be821d567f4f676353d8c9fd95a93d90fe38742030805e270773971aff217bc388a120804feff524b7902947b154ceb2c620000988d3cf640b8ca444c2791f1c4376322b72a53585980ca9180d4d3863d8855ee412a34caf616c416570ef67bd24\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_032\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/d5793af0c6991f20ea650784a1b38e9adc69ec6d352c40fe8c67a0f4d801094c3e17dac4899b3196ab42ddeb4cea6fd6817e6735706162ffd95a361b322823e17611e0809b41974299cceb7a5b31b0607381a0ca8cf821e135239592f2a9d09526034dbd40589c4c659fa1b5ecb2f539f181fa516ca11e30\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_023\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/d8c661589cd2ae863b91c48a11721c99679309ecb0379c673b5fe8948a9d326c673196c7217e342427e2af0504e43610b4d429f41d683dca04d490feef59fc93284b4430c9d461cd8f76b34189867ff700bebc7773aff6f64931c48b99073cf9b4d5d1dc50f7915efcef2a818db0581d529dc917fbb8f12f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_020\"></a></p>\n<p>与之对应的，乌龟的受伤方式也很丰富，被压扁被束缚被电击，统计这玩意儿多少有点受虐狂了。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/242e9b9b175a65a3fbb311f52899b89aa4dab3042e26f8c87a277081879834fd71a2f91366f16cba20620c77619ce7d555fef1dd9af850d39a6ed40c01a5443e0a93cb8be7f92e142ad63b3ad1991f39ee2430f1d587139e3010e188ea5ddc93d799b9683f07cf29bb08ed69a08487b552c944d63ebc9ace\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_010\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/2f61314b5cd9c171efa9cf15d1d96d080d32beb198c6a12038c15d2bd017c6a6ee94d2b681596dc94501434565d2aced4ac8ec28ec405e56da05e59a0f5d36989d5423697e47a613b88162f358c1da1c252879fca8a2794b4b1ab46f39231698d712990af132e3176c4ab13a009508b3a9a9f69968c59f30\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_031\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/99bc8b780ee1a9986b863da943330b03be83e6fff0d8be22f20e4b02e89d056fbe3522aa1de95ab8a6a79806da3c49405e203ee02b969d9a0ffd1d232b525ae8de560ed1ff29af25127999768dde43c3050d4286b4027827aed67397bdca18a73c806a82ad99b52f8c1e141b2345289c4744d5bcf52182e7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_033\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/d40e66ab5e0c46d1d4994888fa71700455547516482dbcb14f7f25056a419339026fd93d8ee14c87433b3ae910984a1269e4ffca2b97698d7422dfa83ffd6088ff107eec741b13061a845654831288f7bea621892b81187ef37e1dd4a40ccfa3c811e26d51d38029f33771bedb4edecab561df795edc3b19\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_019\"></a></p>\n<p>故事方面好像是原创的，但也有说法是基于一个动画版改的，不管怎样都平平无奇。反正爱普莉儿又双叒叕被斯雷德抓走了。这次斯雷德和朗格玩了个大的，把整个曼哈顿搞成了个空岛，有种X-MEN电影的既视感。这也是副标题《曼哈顿计划》的由来。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/f1d837c20d94802327922bb0829f9d8c852afb4f0ffe3efc818bb3b2af74e74e095d319b91e2cf9403e44f6effbe1e4d7e9c9b3f214bb2069f745d70237d050a8296d6f8006d8f0bc23246b75c3f8836b150d16d8ecd12c6c2e645b06c13e5f57e317c9c6d27aac1148f50f08cf13844fd7e55be37681481\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_002\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/b221e3fefdb390bfbaba05d411953d876b3677fefc561291148147a6f880a442951de833fed748dc936b3993ef4ec72fbe8422214ad7d859e2d8797f9f5679f2684341adf11cb230fcc5469de98cbe179569bd67f4a2175d9e1d54b005912ff76dd2f23d06511592809b569204ca42502407b7b20c5d8d0f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_001\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/1bc4198bcb3860f1041e908d70d6136c00a5f80164f2e07f1aca80a4edc5956df304374ff6d53c953475d98bacde37b7f31b66b52e48b70b0499f34f1bc1670d070f1f1de3c9fc58a07f2e5883a5a35db10bd9a3861732d98eb6f333ddf620b134b2c9091caf5f0b283cc98da59a301cb5d622ea85438978\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_040\"></a></p>\n<p>前面几关BOSS除了牛头猪面这俩熟人，还有很多机械怪和变异怪，不少关卡还设置了些不咬人膈应人的中BOSS，不求要命命但求费血那种。其中见到斯雷德之前最难的是第五关的鳄鱼，甩尾巴那一下又快又狠。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/508b1ba7eb27f916342fb87b4d9e36715b18ddc292e44f88edd410510f3b50bdb8ea5914396fa51efb17d5bcbea361650e5849cfae449c6597d278c5a8ccb51b0349a65a25415395d753568a3a32bfe57836f181ca7f3455a4cf75e3798d872a83c34bcbf194eaa1e66fda9946ec89a317f4c5a2cca65d86\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_004\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/c85e0b6f89ee9098ff9dc6fb1ed7e495e7e0e3265717501bece7101b28f3646a9d8707216e8184acca4a2a0996a0b739812dcc996c15744c4b7f414d1fbd1e417ac9b10262d77ea71d62439ead8060b51d52c29d09d71f58f3a4f8e974137ad440f1802fb90cbb6cef3bcbcefc19d2ed1947936eca74103a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_008\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/2d186a4c11da035127e46f12b59d75670dad7e929ee8e54f03bca55a7907874d1780961f90d7972e98f6348ea64da51c439740f2e352acd663c6086183e836eefbcd57e3a6e0406f7ce8f0a4de28045505bd4c7b8453751c58232aa180168ba3997cdace6b9387381e37dd313949c0957c46f1abac20e34b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_012\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/3425411d154fcfc5b4d74075a2225b75577f10ceb19f048b0c8bc1cbc392bf44f65197e9093bc40fe2283645c731ca070354c44538380001754fc41a16cfbed8f46407e7a05d4da457f9b0ff9321f28a8549cbdc04820cf819ee73c78a227284cca589bcd7d0247ab75bbe3ace39d97c1b5f77c0b2948cb5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_015\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/eddc092b1292687193e299ee64a4c4e0f1e1d96b9197b0aee91e2f2f017a38d5098685fcca5c10044af4e9a58eeba77e53adc61ae1a2594bcd1dc0781e43a71ee6f8531c62428db134d28a3c2421c40a07acf4fd1da942b7b8a9f53409e86a4a8b49aea70b185df900d824100c699a367b45c30ae120a654\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_021\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/de3c3a48831985fd1a6bfc04f308bd319fa36360c34899964c78401d0dde54b4b292ef070cc3700d90bf676ea890278f2f11e8d95e0d1e8e86c13ef2e368a168dc63572ff506994fa02be91591882466fccc5c1558d6a05a2de74b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_024\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/bf29393266d2aa00792cbf71c732e53ae0023e961df0b0e9d9da6fb31205a77f07373164b047ff4e0c214b76e0fc4e36f182032b7a10712d5ee2360b73da62c643c11160d954d8457393bf40b0394ce4f465e972686faa53c384fe93b2bed1a29329a53a04d98fb6ad10a2862db67b881758439726d6c346\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_026\"></a></p>\n<p>下面就是打不死的斯雷德了。其实正常打不怎么难，压迫感甚至还没有上一代强。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/420ac2b752cec27dd2053c9d1b4afa408caf05ee94632047f3a33cbee9962cd6a9b89779e64f62e3f4183de672282a815baf8981d61a463053592e6bf2247ab3b0088541c39212d1e04137b6916d07eeb172778f5d3d7771f0995100dbd775d10f5c996973ffa6cab867008e43d0a4c41b27b08fb3060892\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_027\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/8e1df54d0868c85590b1fa6b1b0bacaa53edb85107e0a7bbb8b5119c5a4483d6879c02316592789b87d9ab42410dc2bfaa70bfd62e85409d19f546284bf76a97c961aac33ef833f9b1175a6566d0fd2ecdf8944332cb365df95345ae1b7e3a813fd603ebb7bb4ce7aebd135bd255453e874d05ad94087bfe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_028\"></a></p>\n<p>打完斯雷德之后还有还有两关，守关的是朗格和变异斯雷德。难倒是没多难，只是流程相当的长，打到这会儿注意力都下降了，手更是要搓出腱鞘炎了。以我这臭手当年5块钱都不一定能兜住底。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/6d63874129d3a0bcccac67101ed35dae746252e4c651cebb42370c341cb011c1785d99657f68d587da2fb2cc9bade30a73fab49e7f6c618fe554b9b0c2f1175904a31df1ebb741927ec41abb30b7ef59271646c91c86f9de552b13a8212d33212e2738a0abc5a116f1379d91570126985e0c48dd2d0063ff\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_029\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/1840daa66e83cc0d787a5dcd3344311059e4de33bf8e2b1a73ff4e2c7b105128e6b1d9b9c218aee9e37b1def494eba2855abb78ea49149685fea3313a05dc999f0b4f4d1905679f5e8ac7c8ba9dc998718f5052bb91df2a96fc798b2c9201a2947612e96d06747a2196e9d40fdcdfba2acfd6ce79ab8fa1a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_034\"></a></p>\n<p>守关的斯雷德，形象莫名有点像《幽游白书》里的武威，技能是操控雷电，不过他放雷电大招的时候也是破绽最大的时候，抓机会一顿猛放大招就行。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/9192068a9bac2de8be8906bc6ad3ba80ef4fd84413114fe66b1668b693a8ab74476f804575b7317380603f316f2d9bc3bcdfa208ffe9a858affc35e03d64cbaf6ad33126b099a43b31e265fbc7b249c5f34ca1a0947ec9359079fb06ea212f72e37893bce76f84b04537aef3cec450c84e7f9ac7d070421c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_037\"></a></p>\n<p>通关！<br>\n怨念退散！<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/72aa0c6a8453c518421e528a5343efae2cf2c6e7b5f68338342d69ce61ea824b75afe82149149512db6da74361bd86dbc47cf24eec83ba45887c066c9a9e0f0c3742b66c5ca961156ec4e53af243cf7069572313134668f49c132a9211d21be1c1a9831a619224a17a5a6f370980ad72c9d16872aa0e2e55\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_038\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">(1)</a>：别问为啥用千问，问就是88VIP快到期了，不愿意多注册国产服务。</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div><span>《<a href=\"https://pewae.com/2026/10/teenage-mutant-ninja-turtles-iii-the-manhattan-project.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">忍者神龟3</a>》采用<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">署名-非商业性使用-禁止演绎</a>许可协议进行许可。 『<a href=\"https://pewae.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">破袜子</a>』期待与您交流。</span><div><div><h3>相关推荐:</h3><ul><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2024/09/mega-man-3.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">洛克人3</a><span>[47%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2009/05/e7bb9d-e68b9b.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">绝招</a><span>[43%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2006/07/teenage-mutant-ninja-turtles.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">激龟忍者传</a><span>[42%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2007/07/altered-beast.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">兽王记</a><span>[34%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2015/12/night-night.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">天天天黑</a><span>[33%]</span></li></ul></div></div></div>",
